; editors/turbopascal/hosts: the IDE in a window (docs/plans/plan_pascal.md,
; "The window"): a screen of cells painted with Plan 9's default font,
; a cell a character, the window's size the number of rows and columns.
; Here what the hosts share: Cells (what changed between two screens,
; the PC's colours and box characters, painted on a surface) and
; Picture (a surface in memory, with the font's bits: Linux's hosts',
; and the frames of the tests). sdl/: a window on Linux; draw/: one of
; mini-rio's, under mini-9pi.
(library
 (name ix_turbopascal_hosts)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries ix_terminal ix_graphics ix_core))
